# Go cannot embed files outside its module (frontend/dist is a sibling of
# backend/), so the SPA build output is mirrored into internal/api/dist before
# `go build`. The committed index.html is the placeholder so the embed always
# works; real builds overwrite the rest.
#
# Build step (repo root):
#   npm run build --prefix frontend
#   cp -r frontend/dist/. backend/internal/api/dist/
dist/*
!dist/index.html
